# Intentionally (near-)empty function package for the PreTokenGen Lambda.
#
# The entire module ships in PreTokenGenLayer (sam/pretokengen/layer), so the
# function's own code bundle carries no application code — the handler
# `sam.pretokengen.handler.handler` resolves from the layer's `python/` path.
# SAM still needs a non-empty CodeUri directory to package, which this provides.
